# Observability and SRE Baseline

- Define service SLI/SLO targets before implementation starts.
- Instrument logs, metrics, and traces with correlation IDs.
- Add dashboards and alerts for golden signals (latency, traffic, errors, saturation).
- Include operational runbook for top failure scenarios.

# Incident Readiness

- Define on-call ownership and escalation policy.
- Include rollback and mitigation steps for critical alerts.
